  "title": "Topological sort with Kahn's algorithm",
  "source": {
    "language": "python",
    "code": "queue = [v for v in graph if in_degree[v] == 0]\nresult = []\nwhile queue:\n    u = queue.pop(0)\n    result.append(u)\n    for v in graph[u]:\n        in_degree[v] -= 1\n        if in_degree[v] == 0:\n            queue.append(v)"
